  m_text: '"John, you''ve made it through the second trial. The next area is even
    more dangerous. You''ll need to defend yourself using rocks. Press the left mouse
    button to throw a rock. As it travels, gravity will continuously pull it downward
    while it moves forward, creating a curved path known as projectile motion. Understanding
    this motion will help you hit aliens more accurately and survive the trial."

'
